                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7af27d12-1956-486c-b897-4c175cac9b9d",
                                "sense_id": "b9b2327f-7c2b-30bc-ba88-78e3fd1bbd18",
                                "text": "Co-owner Peter Ryan learned his craft in the bagelries of NYC, and most of his bosses weren't Jewish either, so he has no qualms about offering such un[-]kosher concoctions as ham and Swiss with mayo and sprouts on a whole-wheat bagel.",
                                "translation": "合伙人彼得·瑞安在纽约市的贝果店里学会了这门手艺，而且他的大多数老板也不是犹太人，所以他毫无顾虑提供像火腿瑞士奶酪配蛋黄酱和豆芽这样的非犹太洁食组合，放在全麦贝果上。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d5dfc09-466b-48cc-8b5e-c82e16ba04aa",
                                "sense_id": "b9b2327f-7c2b-30bc-ba88-78e3fd1bbd18",
                                "text": "For some DSA grandees, like NYC chapter co-chair Bianca Cunningham, socialism means a planned economy that replaces market capitalism.",
                                "translation": "对于一些民主社会主义者协会（DSA）的元老级人物，例如纽约市分会联合主席比安卡·坎宁安来说，社会主义意味着用计划经济取代市场资本主义。"
                            }
                        ]
